  "decisions": [
    {
      "topic": "Reduced-motion fallbacks",
      "decision": "Sections whose fallback is grounded in source (intro, deployment, static sections) carry fallbackGrounding \"source\". Sections where the ORIGINAL ignores prefers-reduced-motion (AOS fade, brain loops, blobs, carousel pulses, tree transitions, nav) carry fallbackGrounding \"policy\": the fallback is a design-repo requirement for generated pages, not a measured behaviour.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "cite": "recon/css/index.AtHXy8dp.css:69-71",
          "quote": "@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)"
        },
        {
          "cite": "recon/css/index.AtHXy8dp.css:168-170",
          "quote": "@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "AOS quirk on engine/mcp cards",
      "decision": "Encoded as motion pattern aos-fade-up-cards-snap-quirk (rule order makes card opacity snap and delays inert).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "cite": "recon/css/index.AtHXy8dp.css:1421",
          "quote": ".engine-card{background:#fff"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "Cookie banner analytics",
      "decision": "Clone stores bb_cookie_consent and loads NO analytics; content contract pins loadsThirdPartyScripts:false. The original loads GA/GTM/PostHog after consent (per the clone source comment; not independently re-captured here).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "cite": "src/components/CookieBanner.jsx:4",
          "quote": "The original loads GA/GTM/PostHog"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "Styling approach of the clone",
      "decision": "Original CSS ported verbatim into src/styles/site.css (class names kept), Tailwind preflight disabled and @tailwind base omitted.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "cite": "src/index.css:2",
          "quote": "@import './styles/site.css';"
        },
        {
          "cite": "tailwind.config.js:6",
          "quote": "corePlugins: { preflight: false }"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ungroundedOrApproximate": [
    "Copy budgets (x-maxWords) are a +25% headroom policy over real copy, not a measured limit.",
    "fallbackGrounding:\"policy\" reduced-motion fallbacks (9 of 16 sections) are requirements, not observed behaviour.",
    "MOTION_LOOP_BUDGET (5) and NO_ADJACENT_SECTION_ALT are rhythm heuristics derived from the single measured page.",
    "Array minItems for optional variability (e.g. showcase 3-5 cards, compare rows 3-6) are judgement calls; maxItems equal the real counts.",
    "Template required/optional split: only shell, hero, final CTA and footer are required; the rest are optional by judgement (the real page has all of them).",
    "3D intro geometry/camera paths are WebGL and unmeasurable from the DOM (CLONE_SPEC 19).",
    "Deployment private/on-prem states were verified by DOM class only, not screenshotted (CLONE_SPEC 19).",
    "Desktop language dropdown open state was never opened during recon (CLONE_SPEC 19)."
